linux-redmi-marble (7.2.8+marble5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Ship the exact .config the kernel was built with as
    /usr/share/linux-redmi-marble/config-<release>, next to the kernel.release
    marker. Nothing lands in /boot; the boot chain reads only vmlinuz and the
    DTB from there.
  * One kernel config: the author's reference config with our deviations
    (CONFIG_LTO_CLANG_THIN=y, CONFIG_NTSYNC=m, CONFIG_LOCALVERSION_AUTO=n)
    merged in place, replacing the reference-config + extra-file append step in
    debian/rules. Verified byte-identical olddefconfig output against the old
    two-file flow.

